            <div class="video_bottom-top">
              <h3>
                HOW TO ENTER <br>
                <span> (AND SCORE ADDITIONAL REWARDS): </span>
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="video_bottom-bottom">
              <div class="gird_blocks page-width">
                <div class="grid_block">
                  <div class="gird_block-top">
                    <span class="steps_bug">01</span>
                    <h4>
                      CREATE A FREE <br>
                      GAME ACCOUNT
                    </h4>
                  </div>
                  <div class="gird_block-bottom">
                    <p>
                      Sign up for a free GAME account via email through the form above, or visit the App store to
                      download the Blue Tees GAME App.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid_block">
                  <div class="gird_block-top">
                    <span class="steps_bug">02</span>
                    <h4>
                      INVITE <br>
                      TWO FRIENDS
                    </h4>
                  </div>
                  <div class="gird_block-bottom">
                    <p>
                      Log in to the App, join the “Play with Paige” campaign, and share the link. Once you do that,
                      you’ve just scored your first entry.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid_block">
                  <div class="gird_block-top">
                    <span class="steps_bug">03</span>
                    <h4>
                      GET <br>
                      REWARDED
                    </h4>
                  </div>
                  <div class="gird_block-bottom">
                    <p>
                      Unlock bonus entries + exclusive rewards up to $500 in value, just from inviting more people to
                      the GAME app.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
